- Root Cause Analysis:
  1. Symbol Type:
     - The Symbol table schema historically defined `type_name` rather than `type`, and some serializers omitted `type_name` on scalar entries. `SemanticViewer.jsx` strictly read `sym.type_name`, resulting in an empty `<span className="type-badge"></span>` pill when `sym.type_name` was undefined or null.
  2. Symbol Size:
